WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.340
Welcome to our quick guide to caring for your wool jumper.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.920
First, turn it inside out.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:11.060
Then wash it gently by hand, at the temperature shown.

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:14.620
Finally, dry it flat, away from direct heat.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:16.840
Thanks for watching.
